title: MilitarPhone
---
<<once>>
    <<declare $fifthwave = false>>
    Scientist: Good job! #line:S5-01-scientist
    Scientist: Your efforts are buying us time #line:S5-02-scientist
    Scientist: To understand what when wrong and find a cure. #line:S5-03-scientist

    Military: Killing them is the priority! #line:S5-04-military
    Military: To keep the people of Catility safe! #line:S5-05-military
    Military: These things are getting stronger. #line:S5-06-military
    Military: Some even grew bigger! #line:S5-07-military

    Scientist: Although I believe in permanent solution #line:S5-08-scientist
    Scientist: It is true that they are getting stronger. #line:S5-09-scientist
    <<spawn_new_recipe "military">>    
    Scientist: So we developed another recipe to help you #line:S5-10-scientist
    Scientist: While we try to find a solution. #line:S5-11-scientist
    <<hang_up "military">>
<<else>>
    <<if !$fifthwave>>
        <<jump FifthWave>>
    <<endif>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: FifthWave
---
<<set $fifthwave = true>>
Military: You must use what you have in hand soldier! #line:S6-01-military
Military: Use the cream to glue the walls back together if you must! #line:S6-02-military
Military: The government is doing their best #line:S6-03-military
Miltary: To solve the issue! #line:S6-04-military

Scientist: As they should. #line:S6-05-scientist
Scientist: They got us in this mess in the first place with their impatience! #line:S6-06-scientist

Military: The government has the best interests of the people at front! #line:S6-07-military

Scientist: Right... #line:S6-08-scientist

Military: Remember who you work for! #line:S6-09-military

Scientist: Is that a threat? #line:S6-10-scientist

<<wait  10>>
<<start_wave>>
Scientist: Watch out! They are coming! #line:S6-11-scientist>>
<<hang_up "military">>
===
